# {{n-g|Used to link an [[w:Content clause#Interrogative content clauses|interrogative content clause]] in the following constructions. Usually omitted in English translations. In some cases can also be, and sometimes usually is, omitted in Russian, along with any linked prepositions.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[это|Э́то]] '''то''', [[что]] [[де́лает]] [[нас]] [[счастливый|счастли́выми]].|This is what makes us happy.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''То''', [[что]] [[он]] [[сде́лал]], [[про́сто]] [[недопустимый|недопусти́мо]].|What he did is simply unacceptable.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[это|Э́то]] [[вызванный|вы́звано]] '''тем''', [[что]] [[ты]] [[сказа́л]].|This was caused by what you said.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[мне|Мне]] [[ну́жно]] '''то''', [[над]] [[чем]] [[рабо́тать]].|I need something to work on.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''То''', [[что]] [[не]] [[убива́ет]] [[меня́]], [[де́лает]] [[меня́]] [[сильне́е]].|What doesn't kill me makes me stronger.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[это|Э́то]] [[связанный|свя́зано]] [[с]] '''тем''', [[как]] [[он]] [[ведёт]] [[себя́]].|It's related to how he behaves.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''То''', [[как]] [[он]] [[вёл]] [[себя́]], [[про́сто]] [[недопустимый|недопусти́мо]].|How he behaved is simply unacceptable.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[мы|Мы]] [[говори́м]] [[о]] '''том''', [[как]] [[писа́ть]] [[пра́вильно]].|We're talking about how to write correctly.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[проблема|Пробле́ма]] [[в]] '''том''', [[заче́м]] [[он]] [[э́то]] [[сде́лал]].|The problem lies in why he did it.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[мы|Мы]] [[не]] [[уве́рены]] ([[в]] '''том'''), [[как]] [[он]] [[э́то]] [[сде́лал]].|We're not sure how he did it.}}
# {{lb|ru|usually before {{m|ru|что}}}} {{n-g|Used to link a [[w:Content clause#Declarative content clauses|declarative content clause]] in the following constructions. Often omitted in English translations, but can sometimes be translated as "the fact (that)". In some cases can also be, and sometimes usually is, omitted in Russian, along with any linked prepositions.}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[несмотря на то, что|несмотря́ на '''то́''', что]]|despite '''the fact''' that}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[это|Э́то]] [[всё]] [[из-за]] '''того́''', [[что]] [[ты]] [[не]] [[мо́жешь]] [[взять]] [[на]] [[себя́]] [[отве́тственность]].|This is all due to '''the fact''' that you can't take responsibility.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[мы|Мы]] [[не]] [[уве́рены]] ([[в]] '''том'''), [[что]] [[э́тих]] [[мер]] [[доста́точно]].|We're not sure that these measures are sufficient.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[меня|Меня́]] [[раздража́ет]] ('''то'''), [[что]] [[магази́ны]] [[все]] [[закры́ты]].|It annoys me that the shops are all closed.}}
# {{n-g|Optionally used in the following construction to refer to the thing denoted by {{m|ru|что}} earlier in the sentence. Can be omitted, and in English usually the sentence is translated without it too. Has the meaning "[[that]] [[thing]]".}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[что|Что]] [[не]] [[убива́ет]] [[меня́]], ('''то''') [[де́лает]] [[меня́]] [[сильне́е]].|What doesn't kill me makes me stronger.}}
# {{n-g|Used in various collocations to refer to the content of a sentence or clause just mentioned by the speaker.}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[более того|бо́лее '''того́''']]|moreover/furthermore|lit=more '''than that'''}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[кроме того|кро́ме '''того́''']]|also/additionally|lit=aside '''from that'''}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[и тому подобное|и '''тому́''' подо́бное]]|and that kind of thing|lit=and similar '''to that'''}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[то есть|'''то́''' есть]]|i.e.|lit='''that''' is}}
# {{sid|ru|contrast pronoun}} {{n-g|Used in certain collocations to emphasise contrast with something else.}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[и]] '''то''', [[и]] [[друго́е]]|both|lit=both '''that''' and the other}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[и]] '''то''', [[и]] '''то'''|both|lit=both '''that''' and '''that'''}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''то''' [[и́ли]] [[э́то]]|this or that|lit='''that''' or this}}

